---

This product includes or depends on the following third-party works:

Chromaprint
  The AcoustID audio fingerprinting library. Used via the fpcalc
  binary in the CLI tools, and in the browser demo as a WebAssembly
  build (chromaprint.wasm) loaded as a separate module at runtime.
  Chromaprint is required to generate and verify the fingerprints
  described by the AFS spec.
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1)
  Source:  https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint
  Notice:  The LGPL-2.1 permits use of Chromaprint as a library in
           this project. Users who wish to substitute a modified
           version of Chromaprint may replace the fpcalc binary on
           their PATH, or replace the chromaprint.wasm file shipped
           under demo/vendor/@unimusic/chromaprint/ with their own
           build. The .wasm is loaded at runtime as a separate file,
           satisfying LGPL §6's relinking provision.

@unimusic/chromaprint
  The npm package that packages Chromaprint as an Emscripten WASM
  build along with a thin JS wrapper. The demo uses only the
  vendored chromaprint.js / chromaprint.wasm files from this
  package, calling the C API directly; the wrapper code in the
  package's dist/index.js is not used. The LGPL-2.1 notice above
  governs the bundled chromaprint.wasm regardless of this MIT
  wrapper.
  License: MIT
  Source:  https://github.com/unimusic-app/unimusic-chromaprint
  Notice:  The MIT license text is preserved alongside the vendored
           files at demo/vendor/@unimusic/chromaprint/LICENSE.md.

smol-toml
  Bundled in demo/vendor/smol-toml/ and used by the browser demo to
  parse AFS file headers.
  License: MIT
  Source:  https://github.com/squirrelchat/smol-toml
  Notice:  The MIT license text is preserved alongside the vendored
           source files.

