WhisperX (tools/transcribe-generate)
  Used in the content authoring pipeline (not shipped to demo
  visitors) to produce word-level timestamps for the karaoke and
  subtitled-video demo content. WhisperX wraps OpenAI Whisper +
  wav2vec2 forced alignment.
  License: BSD 4-Clause "Original" or "Old" License
  Source:  https://github.com/m-bain/whisperX
  Notice:  WhisperX is invoked from tools/transcribe-generate as an
           external CLI; it is not bundled with or redistributed by
           AFS Tools. Users who want to regenerate content from
           source install WhisperX themselves into a local
           virtualenv as described in tools/transcribe-generate
           and the project README.
